  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Finance expert advising and supporting CERF in access to climate finance and investment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hura Capital was hired by CERF to:1.	advise and support in the design of preparatory studies and input/issue papers, and the management of these contracted studies.2.	advise and support in the preparation of potentially two investment fora in Indonesia and South Africa respectively.3.	help build the capacity of RVO&apos;s Energy and Climate Team (department for International Development) in the field of investment finance.4.	advise and support in the organisation and implementation of a private climate financing workshop in the Netherlands in March 2023, answering to the motion Erkens Boucke (Kamerstuk 31793 nr. 216) passed by the Dutch Parliament.</narrative>
  </description>
